                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Pick a friendly **^^Big^^** unit that has not used a **^^Fight^^** ability this turn and is wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target. The target can be picked to use a **^^Fight^^** ability immediately after the **^^Fight^^** ability used by this unit has been resolved. Add 1 to hit rolls for attacks made by this unit and the target for the rest of the turn.</characteristic>
